{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured node1 as an NFSv4 server and node2/node3 as persistent clients. Bidirectional sharing, UID/GID 4200 ownership, permissions, and persistence survived sequential restarts of all three nodes.","actions_performed":["Installed NFS packages on all nodes.","Created sharedops with UID/GID 4200 on all systems.","Exported /srv/nfs/shared to 10.100.209.0/24 with ownership sharedops:sharedops and mode 2770.","Persistently mounted the export at /mnt/shared on node2 and node3 using NFSv4.2.","Verified immediate bidirectional file visibility with ownership 4200:4200 and mode 0660.","Restarted each node individually and verified changed boot identity and full recovery."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Shared identity on all nodes","command_ids":["cmd-9f7b11419296401c","cmd-01c23d53762c47c4","cmd-ab28d0c94c4b4485"],"summary":"All systems report sharedops with UID and GID 4200."},{"requirement":"NFSv4 server export and directory permissions","command_ids":["cmd-2de9ffd7dde74e1e"],"summary":"NFS server is active/enabled, port 2049 is listening, the export is restricted to 10.100.209.0/24, and the directory is sharedops:sharedops mode 2770."},{"requirement":"Persistent NFSv4 client mounts","command_ids":["cmd-c64da61d761d4323","cmd-bfe2a3c2de7e4861"],"summary":"Both clients mounted node1’s export at /mnt/shared using NFSv4.2."},{"requirement":"Post-restart bidirectional visibility and retained ownership","command_ids":["cmd-242ff5121ec64628","cmd-6aec4d4f75e84f1e","cmd-761392eec1a1485f"],"summary":"After every node restart, files created from each client were immediately visible on the other as sharedops:sharedops (4200:4200), mode 0660."},{"requirement":"node1 restart and NFS recovery","command_ids":["cmd-cc7f679c54434f7c","cmd-90610fe26de34272","cmd-d1d2905839444835","cmd-cf8cfbebeb714e5f","cmd-d3e8a02528e94a6d"],"summary":"Captured healthy baseline, acknowledged restart, proved boot UUID changed, and verified the NFS service, export, data, and client access recovered."},{"requirement":"node2 restart and mount recovery","command_ids":["cmd-fc86bfce6a3042dc","cmd-5dcef91d3e9547c3","cmd-39ef9e88a14c4e62","cmd-4f0e0c3d82e6429d"],"summary":"Captured healthy baseline, acknowledged restart, proved boot UUID changed, and verified the persistent NFSv4.2 mount, identity, ownership, and data recovered."},{"requirement":"node3 restart and mount recovery","command_ids":["cmd-3a22a80321af41a0","cmd-f18887e4abcf4dc2","cmd-dcdf303ee7aa413e","cmd-51051c19b41944f8"],"summary":"Captured healthy baseline, acknowledged restart, proved boot UUID changed, and verified the persistent NFSv4.2 mount, identity, ownership, and data recovered."}]}
